    "id": "adapter",
    "pattern": "Adapter",
    "category": "Structural",
    "instance": "VizJs output-stream bridge",
    "intent": "Expose a string-returning JavaScript layout engine through PlantUML's existing Graphviz output-stream interface.",
    "evidence": "GraphvizJs implements Graphviz.createFile3(OutputStream). It submits a VizJsEngine.execute(dotString) operation, obtains its SVG String, writes bytes to the requested stream and returns ProcessState. VizJsEngine reflectively calls ch.braincell.viz.VizJS. This incompatible-interface conversion establishes Adapter intent. Optional VizJs execution is not claimed.",
